OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 20 APR
OL,4,G0630FThe Gary Davies Breakfast Show
OL,5,     GMasterChef is back... and Gary
OL,6,     Gmeets the new judge Anna Haugh!
OL,7,G0930FVernon Kay
OL,8,     GMaking your mid-mornings
OL,9,     Gmemorable, Vernon's bringing big
OL,10,     Gtunes, big names and big laughs
OL,11,     Gto weekdays. Whatever you're up
OL,12,     Gto, Vern wants to hear from you -
OL,13,     Gemail vernon@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G1200FJeremy Vine
OL,15,     GJeremy and guests discuss the
OL,16,     Gnews headlines and talk to the
OL,17,     Gpeople making them.
OL,18,G1400FTrevor Nelson
OL,19,     GTrevor is bringing you some of
OL,20,     Gthe best music from across the
OL,21,     Gdecades to get you through the
OL,22,     Gafternoon.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
